  sequenceLabelId: GlobalStoneFocus_EN
  narrativeCategory: 2
  dialogueLines:
  - subtitleText: 'A Jewish memorial stone is an open book. It often starts with
      ''Here is buried'' and ends with the biblical verse from Samuel: ''May his
      or her soul be bound up in the bundle of life''. This usually speaks of the
      hope for eternal life.'
